{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================
  ak-notebook-product.liquid  —  PRODUCT PAGE notebook class hook (PDP-2A)
  ============================================================
  First notebook-theme proof for individual product pages.

  Purpose:
    - Adds the page class `ak-pdp-page` to <html> so the additive,
      page-class-gated CSS in sections/main-product.liquid's existing
      {%- style -%} block can repaint ONLY the main product section to
      notebook paper and move ONLY the product title to 'AK Due Date'.
    - Renders the shared ak-notebook-drawer snippet so the self-hosted
      `@font-face 'AK Due Date'` is available on product routes (the same
      face the other notebook surfaces use; reuses assets/ak-due-date.woff2,
      no new asset).

  Why the font lock lives in main-product.liquid (not here):
    main-product.liquid sets `#MainProduct-{id} * { font-family:Impact
    !important }` and `#MainProduct-{id} { background:#000 !important }` —
    ID(1,0,0)+!important rules that NO external class/element selector can
    beat. So the winning overrides (html.ak-pdp-page #MainProduct-{{section.id}}
    = (1,1,1)) must be authored inside that section's style block, which
    owns {{ section.id }}. This snippet is the hook + font loader only.

  Scope of THIS pass (PDP-2A): hook + contained paper + title font ONLY.
    NO commerce markup/JS. NOT styling: price, description, variant picker,
    quantity, Add to Cart, Shop Pay, media/gallery. NO doodles.

  Hosted from templates/product.json (custom_liquid_akpdp, after ak-top /
  before main) so it renders ONLY on product routes — the class is route-
  bounded by construction (no leak to non-product pages).

  Note: ak-notebook-drawer's drawer styling is scoped to the 9 original
  notebook page classes, NOT ak-pdp-page, so the MENU drawer on product
  pages stays its dark-Impact baseline in PDP-2A (theming it would require
  adding ak-pdp-page to that snippet — out of scope here).

  Revert: delete this file + the custom_liquid_akpdp host (+ order entry)
  in templates/product.json + the `STAGE PDP-2A` block in main-product.liquid.
  ============================================================
{%- endcomment -%}
<script>
  (function(){ document.documentElement.classList.add('ak-pdp-page'); })();
</script>
{% render 'ak-notebook-drawer' %}

<style>
  /* ============================================================
     PDP-CORR-2A — PRODUCT PAYMENT / FOOTER / FONT SUPPORT
     Page-scoped (html.ak-pdp-page), CSS-only. Corrective fixes after PDP-2B:
     (A) load the 'AK Tenada' '#'-only face so the product description's
     '#FreeVitaly' renders the stencil hash (Narrative parity; the description
     font stack itself lives in main-product.liquid PDP-CORR-2A); (B) ink the
     readable-on-yellow payment text; (C) ink the Shop Pay installments host;
     (D) notebook-font the footer CTA (ak-footer added to product.json this
     pass). NO header/nav, NO body full-bleed, NO drawer, NO control skin,
     NO doodles (those are PDP-CORR-2B / PDP-2C / PDP-2D). Revert: delete this
     <style> block (and the ak-footer entry in templates/product.json).
     ============================================================ */

  /* (A) 'AK Tenada' — 1.3KB OFL '#'-only subset (U+23). Reuses
     assets/ak-tenada.woff2 (no new asset); every non-'#' glyph falls through
     to AK Due Date. Mirrors the narrative/products @font-face exactly. */
  @font-face{
    font-family: 'AK Tenada';
    src: url('{{ 'ak-tenada.woff2' | asset_url }}') format('woff2');
    font-weight: normal;
    font-style: normal;
    font-display: swap;
    unicode-range: U+23;
  }

  /* (B) "More payment options" link (light DOM, was white via
     var(--color-foreground)) -> ink for the yellow paper. Underline + click
     behaviour untouched. (0,2,1) beats section-main-product.css's (0,1,0). */
  html.ak-pdp-page .shopify-payment-button__more-options{
    color:#15120b !important;
  }

  /* (C) Shop Pay installments banner host <shopify-payment-terms>. Its text is
     in shadow DOM but inherits the host `color` (runtime-verified), so inking
     the host inks the "Pay in 4… / Learn more" text. Fallback if a future Shop
     Pay render stops inheriting: replace with a readable host chip (dark bg +
     light text). Host box only — the native Shop Pay button is untouched. */
  html.ak-pdp-page shopify-payment-terms{
    color:#15120b !important;
  }

  /* (D) Footer back-to-top CTA ("CLICK HERE TO GET TOP", rendered by the
     ak-footer section added to product.json this pass) -> notebook 'AK Due
     Date' voice, matching the other notebook pages. Copy is letters+spaces
     only (glyph-safe). The CTA keeps ak-footer's own surface + colour +
     scroll behaviour — font-family only here. */
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-btt-text{
    font-family:'AK Due Date', Impact, Haettenschweiler, 'Arial Narrow Bold', sans-serif !important;
  }

  /* ============================================================
     PDP-CORR-2B — PRODUCT NOTEBOOK SHELL / HEADER / FOOTER
     Page-scoped (html.ak-pdp-page), CSS-only. Makes the WHOLE product route
     read as one notebook page: full-bleed legal-pad paper behind the ak-top
     header + footer, the proven mask-PNG ink nav (ported verbatim from
     snippets/ak-notebook-products.liquid, prefix renamed .ak-products-page ->
     .ak-pdp-page), PRODUCTS active (CSS-only — /products/* has no route-native
     .is-active tile), the ak-footer surface on paper, and a related-products
     title-ink backstop. SUPERSEDES the PDP-2A "contained" paper scope but
     PRESERVES the PDP-2A #MainProduct section paper (opaque, untouched). NO
     ak-top.liquid / ak-footer.liquid / main-product.liquid / product.json
     edit, NO doodles, NO control skin, NO media framing, NO commerce change.
     Revert: delete this block (the product-page drawer scope is a separate
     PDP-CORR-2B block in snippets/ak-notebook-drawer.liquid).
     ============================================================ */

  /* (A) FULL-BLEED NOTEBOOK PAPER — beats the global html,body{background:#000}
     net ONLY on html.ak-pdp-page (specificity html.ak-pdp-page body = (0,1,2)
     > the net's body (0,0,1)). side-gap = clamp(40px,6vw,120px) matches the
     PDP-2A #MainProduct margins so the red/blue vertical rules stay continuous
     through the product section. Same house values as the other notebook pages. */
  html.ak-pdp-page{
    --ak-paper-top-gap: clamp(150px, 17vw, 220px);
    --ak-paper-bottom-gap: clamp(130px, 12vw, 190px);
  }
  html.ak-pdp-page body{
    --ak-paper-side-gap: clamp(40px, 6vw, 120px);
    background-color:#f5dd4f !important;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(90deg,
        transparent calc(100% - var(--ak-paper-side-gap)),
        rgba(44,120,180,.60) calc(100% - var(--ak-paper-side-gap)),
        rgba(44,120,180,.60) calc(100% - var(--ak-paper-side-gap) + 2px),
        transparent calc(100% - var(--ak-paper-side-gap) + 2px)),   /* blue RIGHT margin rule */
      linear-gradient(90deg,
        transparent var(--ak-paper-side-gap),
        rgba(218,40,50,.74) var(--ak-paper-side-gap),
        rgba(218,40,50,.74) calc(var(--ak-paper-side-gap) + 2px),
        transparent calc(var(--ak-paper-side-gap) + 2px)),          /* red LEFT margin rule */
      linear-gradient(180deg,
        #f5dd4f 0, #f5dd4f var(--ak-paper-top-gap),
        transparent var(--ak-paper-top-gap)),                       /* blank yellow TOP band (clean behind logo/nav) */
      linear-gradient(180deg,
        transparent calc(100% - var(--ak-paper-bottom-gap)),
        #f5dd4f calc(100% - var(--ak-paper-bottom-gap) + 36px)),     /* blank yellow BOTTOM band (lines fade before footer) */
      repeating-linear-gradient(180deg,
        transparent 0 31px,
        rgba(44,120,180,.60) 31px 32px) !important;                 /* blue horizontal ruled lines */
    background-repeat:no-repeat, no-repeat, no-repeat, no-repeat, repeat !important;
    background-position:0 0, 0 0, 0 0, 0 0, 0 var(--ak-paper-top-gap) !important;
    background-attachment:scroll, scroll, scroll, scroll, scroll !important;
  }
  /* page chrome transparent so the body paper shows behind header/sections/footer.
     The PDP-2A #MainProduct paper is on the inner product-info element (its own id),
     NOT .shopify-section, so it is unaffected. */
  html.ak-pdp-page #MainContent{ background:transparent !important; }
  html.ak-pdp-page #MainContent .gradient{ background:transparent !important; background-image:none !important; }
  html.ak-pdp-page .shopify-section{ background:transparent !important; }

  /* (B) HEADER / NAV — verbatim port of ak-notebook-products.liquid (lines
     291-391) with the prefix renamed to .ak-pdp-page. Mask-PNG ink wordmarks
     on paper, purple hover, cart ink, divider/spacing. ak-top.liquid UNTOUCHED. */
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-wrap{ background:transparent !important; }
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-wrap::after{ background:none !important; }
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-label{ color:#15120b !important; }
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-bad{ color:#15120b !important; }
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-mobile-trigger{ color:#15120b !important; text-shadow:none !important; }
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-label::before,
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-label::after{ opacity:0 !important; }
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-tile:hover .ak-top-label,
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-bad:hover,
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-mobile-trigger:hover{ color:#ff33ff !important; }

  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-cart-container{ transform:translateX(clamp(4px, .6vw, 10px)) !important; }
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-cart-img{ filter:brightness(0) !important; }
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-cart-link:hover .ak-top-cart-img,
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-cart-link:focus-visible .ak-top-cart-img{
    filter:brightness(0) drop-shadow(0 0 6px #ff33ff) drop-shadow(0 0 12px rgba(255,51,255,.5)) !important;
  }
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-divider{ display:none !important; }
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-nav-panel{ padding-top:clamp(2px,0.6vw,8px) !important; }
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-nav-area{ margin-top:clamp(-22px,-2.2vw,-8px) !important; }

  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-life{    --ak-nav-mask:url("https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0930/3267/7656/files/lifestyle_button.png?v=1780886497"); --ak-nav-png-size:clamp(260px, 21vw, 400px);   --ak-nav-tilt:-2.2deg; }
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-products{--ak-nav-mask:url("https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0930/3267/7656/files/products_button.png?v=1780886497");  --ak-nav-png-size:clamp(280px, 23vw, 430px);   --ak-nav-tilt:1.4deg; }
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-archive{ --ak-nav-mask:url("https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0930/3267/7656/files/archive_button.png?v=1780885375");   --ak-nav-png-size:clamp(270px, 22vw, 420px);   --ak-nav-tilt:-1.1deg; }
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-narrative{--ak-nav-mask:url("https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0930/3267/7656/files/narrative_button.png?v=1780885375"); --ak-nav-png-size:clamp(265px, 21.5vw, 410px); --ak-nav-tilt:1.8deg; }
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-contact{ --ak-nav-mask:url("https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0930/3267/7656/files/moniker_button.png?v=1780885375");   --ak-nav-png-size:clamp(220px, 18vw, 340px);   --ak-nav-tilt:-1.6deg; }
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-bad{ --ak-nav-tilt:-2.5deg; }
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-candy{ --ak-nav-tilt:1.2deg; }

  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-life,
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-products,
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-archive,
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-narrative,
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-contact,
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-bad,
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-candy{
    transform:none !important; -webkit-transform:none !important;
    background-image:none !important; filter:none !important;
    transition-property:filter, color, opacity, background-color !important;
    will-change:auto !important;
  }
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-life::before,
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-products::before,
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-archive::before,
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-narrative::before,
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-contact::before{
    content:"" !important; display:block !important; position:absolute !important;
    left:50% !important; top:50% !important;
    width:var(--ak-nav-png-size) !important; height:var(--ak-nav-png-size) !important;
    transform:translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(var(--ak-nav-tilt)) translateZ(0) !important;
    -webkit-transform:translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(var(--ak-nav-tilt)) translateZ(0) !important;
    transform-origin:center center !important;
    backface-visibility:hidden !important; -webkit-backface-visibility:hidden !important;
    pointer-events:none !important;
    background-color:#15120b !important;
    -webkit-mask:var(--ak-nav-mask) center / contain no-repeat !important;
    mask:var(--ak-nav-mask) center / contain no-repeat !important;
    transition:background-color .12s ease, opacity .12s ease !important;
    z-index:1 !important;
  }
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-life:hover::before, html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-life:focus-visible::before, html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-life:active::before,
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-products:hover::before, html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-products:focus-visible::before, html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-products:active::before,
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-archive:hover::before, html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-archive:focus-visible::before, html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-archive:active::before,
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-narrative:hover::before, html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-narrative:focus-visible::before, html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-narrative:active::before,
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-contact:hover::before, html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-contact:focus-visible::before, html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-contact:active::before{
    background-color:#ff33ff !important;
  }
  /* PRODUCTS ACTIVE on /products/* — no route-native .is-active on product
     routes, so the active cue (purple wordmark + magenta halo, paint-only) is
     applied DIRECTLY to the PRODUCTS tile ::before (the same body as the
     .is-active::before rule on the other notebook pages). */
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-products::before{
    background-color:#ff33ff !important;
    filter:
      drop-shadow(0 0 4px #ff33ff)
      drop-shadow(0 0 12px rgba(255,51,255,.75))
      drop-shadow(0 0 24px rgba(255,51,255,.5)) !important;
  }
  /* keep the labels in the DOM for screen readers, visually hidden in all states */
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-life .ak-top-label, html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-life:hover .ak-top-label, html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-life:focus-visible .ak-top-label, html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-life:active .ak-top-label,
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-products .ak-top-label, html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-products:hover .ak-top-label, html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-products:focus-visible .ak-top-label, html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-products:active .ak-top-label,
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-archive .ak-top-label, html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-archive:hover .ak-top-label, html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-archive:focus-visible .ak-top-label, html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-archive:active .ak-top-label,
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-narrative .ak-top-label, html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-narrative:hover .ak-top-label, html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-narrative:focus-visible .ak-top-label, html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-narrative:active .ak-top-label,
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-contact .ak-top-label, html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-contact:hover .ak-top-label, html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-contact:focus-visible .ak-top-label, html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-contact:active .ak-top-label{
    color:transparent !important; text-shadow:none !important;
  }
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-bad-mask{
    transform:scale(1.18) rotate(var(--ak-nav-tilt)) translateZ(0) !important;
    -webkit-transform:scale(1.18) rotate(var(--ak-nav-tilt)) translateZ(0) !important;
  }
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-top-candy-img{
    transform:scale(1.75) rotate(var(--ak-nav-tilt)) translateZ(0) !important;
    -webkit-transform:scale(1.75) rotate(var(--ak-nav-tilt)) translateZ(0) !important;
  }

  /* (C) FOOTER — paper shows behind the ak-footer, ink back-to-top. The
     .ak-btt-text FONT is already set in the PDP-CORR-2A block above; here only
     the footer SURFACE + CTA colours change. ak-footer.liquid NOT edited; id
     "AkBackToTop" / aria-label / scroll-to-top JS / focus-visible / hover /
     reduced-motion all untouched. */
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-footer{ background:transparent !important; }
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-btt{ color:#15120b !important; }                     /* .ak-btt-text inherits ink */
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-footer-copy{ color:rgba(21,18,11,.5) !important; }
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-btt:hover .ak-btt-text,
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-btt:focus-visible .ak-btt-text{ color:#ff33ff !important; } /* preserve purple hover/focus */
  html.ak-pdp-page .ak-footer-rule{ background:none !important; }           /* remove footer glow line (keep spacing) */

  /* (D) RELATED PRODUCTS — full-bleed paper exposes the related-products grid
     (white Impact card titles, invisible on yellow). Smallest readability
     backstop: ink the card titles (color ONLY; scoped to .related-products;
     NO grid/card snippet or global card CSS edit; sizing/links/badges
     untouched). Not a redesign — a follow-up may style the cards further. */
  html.ak-pdp-page .related-products .card-wrapper .card__heading,
  html.ak-pdp-page .related-products .card-wrapper .card__heading a,
  html.ak-pdp-page .related-products .card-wrapper .card__information .full-unstyled-link{
    color:#15120b !important;
  }

  /* ============================================================
     STAGE PDP-CORR-2C — PRODUCT MEDIA MODAL NOTEBOOK PREVIEW
     The Dawn product image modal (<product-modal class="product-media-modal">,
     opened from the gallery) is a full-screen BLACK overlay whose close X is
     buried under the fixed top-right cart button. This block (CSS-ONLY, page-
     scoped html.ak-pdp-page) (1) raises the OPEN modal above the header/cart so
     the close X wins the top-right corner, (2) repaints the black layers to a
     dim legal-pad paper backdrop, (3) puts each media item on a white paper
     stage, and (4) re-inks the close X into a visible notebook chip.
     KEY MECHANIC: ModalDialog (assets/global.js) moves <product-modal> to
     <body> (leaves #MainContent), so these selectors are authored as
     html.ak-pdp-page .product-media-modal* — the host's #MainContent
     transparency rules @153-155 do NOT reach the relocated modal. NO edit to
     the modal markup (product-media-modal.liquid), the modal JS (product-
     modal.js / global.js — open/close/ESC/click-outside/focus-trap/scroll-lock
     all preserved), assets/section-main-product.css, or sections/ak-top.liquid
     (the cart button is untouched — just covered by the raised modal while
     open, and restored on close). NO doodles, NO JS, NO assets, NO commerce
     change. Revert: delete this block (modal returns to black + the z conflict).
     ============================================================ */

  /* (1) Z-INDEX — raise the OPEN modal above .ak-top-wrap (z 999), the fixed
     .ak-top-cart-container (z 9999) and the mobile drawer (z 99999) so the
     modal + its close X own the top-right corner. (0,3,1)+!important beats the
     section's .product-media-modal[open]{z-index:101} (section-main-product.css
     @618). */
  html.ak-pdp-page .product-media-modal[open]{ z-index:100000 !important; }

  /* (2) BACKDROP — black -> dim legal-pad paper. OPAQUE base (no scrim) so the
     inked-black cart/header behind the modal cannot bleed through. The dark
     layers are the .color-{scheme}.gradient on __dialog/__content; neutralise
     them and paint the wrapper. */
  html.ak-pdp-page .product-media-modal{
    background-color:#e7d24c !important;                               /* dim legal-pad yellow */
    background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0 31px, rgba(44,120,180,.30) 31px 32px) !important; /* subtle blue ruled lines */
  }
  html.ak-pdp-page .product-media-modal__dialog,
  html.ak-pdp-page .product-media-modal__content{
    background-color:transparent !important; background-image:none !important; /* let the wrapper paper show through */
  }

  /* (3) WHITE IMAGE STAGE — each media item on a warm-white paper card + ink
     stroke + offset shadow (gives transparent-PNG products an opaque stage and
     frames opaque photos). PAINT-ONLY: width / max-width / margin / aspect from
     section-main-product.css are NOT restated -> media dimensions + zoom usefulness
     preserved. Applies to every media child wrapper (img/video/model/iframe);
     the white card frames each consistently. */
  html.ak-pdp-page .product-media-modal__content > *{
    background:#fffef8 !important;
    border:2px solid #15120b !important;
    box-shadow:6px 6px 0 rgba(21,18,11,.22) !important;
  }

  /* (4) CLOSE X — a visible ink-on-paper notebook chip (its base bg was the dark
     scheme colour -> invisible on paper). Sits above the media (its own
     z-index:2 @698 unchanged) and now above the cart (modal raised). Purple
     hover/focus; markup + JS untouched. */
  html.ak-pdp-page .product-media-modal__toggle{
    color:#15120b !important;
    background:#fffef8 !important;
    border:2px solid #15120b !important;
    box-shadow:4px 4px 0 rgba(21,18,11,.22) !important;
  }
  html.ak-pdp-page .product-media-modal__toggle svg,
  html.ak-pdp-page .product-media-modal__toggle .icon{ color:#15120b !important; }
  html.ak-pdp-page .product-media-modal__toggle:hover,
  html.ak-pdp-page .product-media-modal__toggle:focus-visible{
    color:#ff33ff !important; border-color:#ff33ff !important;
  }
  /* NOTEBOOK-MOBILE-RULES-1: hide notebook vertical margin rules on mobile only (push both off-screen via the shared inset var; paper fill, top/bottom bands, and horizontal ruled lines unaffected; desktop unchanged). Revert: delete this @media line. */
  @media (max-width:749px){ html.ak-pdp-page body{ --ak-paper-side-gap:-60px !important; } }
</style>
